Frames and Layers pages: select many frames or layers and duplicate, delete, reorder, or merge them in one go, with up to 128 layers per frame. Symmetry: mirror strokes across a movable axis, plus the Outline tool and Replace color. Also new: Crop canvas, 1:1 imports that park the overhang in the gutter, five gradient dither families, Replay paced by working time, brushes exactly Size wide, Copy from the whole frame, Diagonal fill, a launch that never waits on the network, and fixes.